{
  "info": {
    "name": "ACME Team Management API",
    "description": "CRUD operations for all four ACME Lambda microservices:\n- Individuals\n- Teams\n- Achievements\n- Metadata (Locations + Enums)\n\nSet the following collection variables before running:\n- `individuals_url`  — Individuals Lambda URL\n- `teams_url`        — Teams Lambda URL\n- `achievements_url` — Achievements Lambda URL\n- `metadata_url`     — Metadata Lambda URL\n- `token`            — Bearer JWT (set automatically by the Login request)\n\nRun the folders top-to-bottom; each folder's pre-request script seeds IDs\ninto collection variables so later requests can reference them.",
